This license covers this repository's own original code: build/patch/package
scripts (`scripts/`), the `cxcompatdb` backend switcher
(`runtime/cxcompatdb/`), the Swift configurator
(`runtime/configurator-gui/`), and the patches under `patches/`.

It does not cover, and does not grant any rights to, third-party components
this repo builds against or optionally stages:
- Wine and CrossOver (CodeWeavers) sources used as a build input — not
  vendored in this repo; obtained separately, under their own licenses.
- Apple's Game Porting Toolkit (GPTK) / D3DMetal — optional, user-supplied,
  never bundled here; obtain and use it under Apple's own GPTK license.
- DXMT (`renderers/dxmt/`) — see its own NOTICE for upstream attribution.
- Microsoft redistributables (DirectX, Visual C++) — not vendored or bundled
  here. The engine only declares which files it needs in
  `config/redist-manifest.json`; `runtime/redist-fetch/gamma_redist.py`
  fetches them from Microsoft's own public installers at wrapper-setup time,
  under Microsoft's redistributable terms.
